{"title":"Silver","slug":"Silver","hero":{"file":"Silver_Ore.webp","width":400,"height":362},"pageid":3280,"revid":15340,"timestamp":"2024-10-16T23:53:03Z","lastEditor":"GOLDmookie","categories":["Ores"],"infobox":{"type":"Ore","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay"},{"label":"Refined","value":"$61/stud"},{"label":"Forged","value":"$86/stud"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.67.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"9/21/2024"},{"label":"Status","value":"Obtainable"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p><b>Silver</b> is an common, grey ore found on <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Ferwater/\">Ferwater Island</a> within <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Sandslate/\">Sandslate</a> nodes. It is found in the caves of the desert.\n</p><p>This ore can be easily mistaken for other ores like <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Iron/\">Iron</a>, <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Zinc/\">Zinc</a>, and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Tin/\">Tin</a> due to its brighter and darker shades in its forms.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>"}
